<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#2b2b2b">
<p>Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
<p>With your renewal coming up on <b>{!Contact.Yelp_Renewal_Date__c}</b>, I want to make sure {!Contact.Yelp_Account_Name__c} goes into 2027 with a plan that's working for every location, old and new.</p>
<p>Here's what I'd suggest we put together:</p>
<ul>
<li>A <b>launch scorecard</b> for each new location: leads, cost per lead and calls in the first 60 days, side by side with your established locations.</li>
<li><b>Budget recommendations</b> by location for 2027, based on what's performing.</li>
<li>Renewal options that fit that plan.</li>
</ul>
<p>Can we grab 30 minutes in the next two weeks? Reply with a time, or I can send a few options.</p>
<p>Thanks,<br>{!User.FirstName}<br>Account Manager, Yelp for Business</p>
</div>
